{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53434","headline":"弄珠吟 · 慧藏","name":"弄珠吟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"落落明珠耀百千，森萝万像镜中悬。\n光透三千越大千，四生六类一灵源。\n凡圣闻珠谁不羡，瞥起心求浑不见。\n对面看珠不识珠，寻珠逐物当时变。\n千般万般况珠喻，珠离百非超四句。\n只这珠生是不生，非爲无生珠始住。\n如意珠，大圆镜，亦有人中（《宗》作「中人」）唤作性。\n分身百亿我珠分，无始本净如今净。\n日用真珠是佛陀，何劳逐物浪波波。\n隐现则（《宗》作「即」）今无二相，对面看珠识得摩（《宗》作「麽」）。\n（见《祖堂集》卷十四，《宗镜录》卷十一收末九句）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"慧藏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53434.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53434","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}